WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.789
Old Jehan, little Nello, and Patrasche, the great working dog of Flanders, lived happily together.

2
00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:12.563
Their meals came from their little garden.

3
00:00:12.564 --> 00:00:18.750
They had only a little money, which Jehan earned by delivering milk.

4
00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:26.211
Every day, Jehan filled a little green cart with cans of milk from his neighbors.

5
00:00:26.212 --> 00:00:30.890
He pulled the cart to Antwerp, where he sold the milk.

6
00:00:30.891 --> 00:00:35.572
Jehan's neighbors knew he was an honest man.

7
00:00:35.573 --> 00:00:41.427
They happily let him deliver their milk and collect the money for them.

8
00:00:41.428 --> 00:00:45.745
But it was becoming hard work for the old man.

9
00:00:45.746 --> 00:00:51.623
He was 83, and the town of Antwerp was three miles away.

10
00:00:51.624 --> 00:00:59.479
Nello was too little to help, and every day, the trip took Jehan longer and longer.

11
00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:06.855
When Patrasche was well again, he watched Jehan load the milk cans onto his cart.

12
00:01:06.856 --> 00:01:12.212
Then he watched as Jehan started slowly down the road.

13
00:01:12.213 --> 00:01:17.323
The next morning, Patrasche jumped up from his straw bed.

14
00:01:17.324 --> 00:01:23.375
He went over to Jehan and pushed him happily with his nose.

15
00:01:23.376 --> 00:01:29.667
"What are you doing, Patrasche?" the old man scolded playfully.

16
00:01:29.668 --> 00:01:32.755
"Come on, out of my way.

17
00:01:32.756 --> 00:01:36.528
I have to take this milk into town."

18
00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:40.988
Patrasche walked over to the cart and barked.

19
00:01:40.989 --> 00:01:47.231
Patrasche placed himself between the cart's handles and stood patiently.

20
00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:51.858
He wanted to show Jehan that he could pull the cart.

21
00:01:51.859 --> 00:01:57.330
Although Jehan understood, he resisted Patrasche's idea.

22
00:01:57.331 --> 00:02:02.979
Jehan thought it was wrong to make dogs work like slaves.

23
00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:08.799
Jehan tried to shoo him away, but Patrasche was stubborn.

24
00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:14.841
He tried to pull the cart with his teeth and managed to move it a little.

25
00:02:14.842 --> 00:02:18.758
Then he stood patiently again, as if to say,

26
00:02:18.759 --> 00:02:24.079
"I am a strong dog, and I can help."

27
00:02:24.081 --> 00:02:27.650
Eventually, Jehan smiled.

28
00:02:27.651 --> 00:02:33.422
"You are a very persistent dog," he said, patting him.

29
00:02:33.423 --> 00:02:37.865
Jehan understood that Patrasche was grateful.

30
00:02:37.866 --> 00:02:43.395
He knew Patrasche wanted to repay him for everything he had done.

31
00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:48.738
That evening, Jehan made a harness for Patrasche.

32
00:02:48.739 --> 00:02:54.405
After that, Patrasche dutifully pulled the cart every morning.

33
00:02:54.406 --> 00:02:58.796
The bells on his harness jingled as he walked.

34
00:02:58.797 --> 00:03:03.554
Whenever Jehan tried to help, Patrasche barked.

35
00:03:03.555 --> 00:03:05.811
It was as if he were saying,

36
00:03:05.812 --> 00:03:10.583
"It is my job, and I will do my duty."

37
00:03:10.585 --> 00:03:14.065
Sadly, Jehan grew weaker.

38
00:03:14.066 --> 00:03:19.376
When the winter came, he was thankful for Patrasche's help.

39
00:03:19.377 --> 00:03:22.647
Snow and mud covered the road.

40
00:03:22.648 --> 00:03:29.563
Without Patrasche, he would not have been able to deliver the milk through the cold.

41
00:03:29.564 --> 00:03:33.988
But for Patrasche, the work seemed like heaven.

42
00:03:33.989 --> 00:03:40.370
It was fun to pull the bright green cart with its shiny brass milk cans.

43
00:03:40.371 --> 00:03:42.765
No one whipped him.

44
00:03:42.766 --> 00:03:50.261
Instead, the kind old man walked beside him, often giving him a gentle pat.

45
00:03:50.262 --> 00:03:55.614
Besides, Patrasche finished his work by early afternoon.

46
00:03:55.615 --> 00:04:07.329
Then he was free to do as he wished─to stretch, to sleep in the sun, to wander in the fields, or to play with other dogs.

47
00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:12.314
Patrasche was happiest of all when he played with Nello.

48
00:04:12.315 --> 00:04:16.241
Nello and Patrasche were best friends.

49
00:04:16.242 --> 00:04:19.662
In fact, they were very similar.

50
00:04:19.663 --> 00:04:27.290
They were both orphans, and Jehan had looked after them both and saved their lives.

51
00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:37.302
Since Patrasche first arrived at the little hut, the friendship between the boy and the dog had strengthened every day.

52
00:04:37.303 --> 00:04:42.784
They played together every afternoon and loved each other greatly.

53
00:04:42.785 --> 00:04:50.656
The big dog and little Nello were never long apart.

